{"3879660": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "OverField", "steam_appid": 3879660, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879660/extras/8815e45974565a718304f2e9fa1ad396.avif?t=1787882916\" width=1560 height=406 /></span>Worldview</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rota Tech is recruiting new members! You'll become the new Leader of the exploration team through tests!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this world lies a hidden realm known as the “OverField”—a mysterious frontier at the very heart of Rota’s research. You'll encounter various events with explorers, face challenges from mysterious forces, and uncover the truth behind the “OverField”.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >▼Game Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >◆Fantastical &quot;Field&quot; Within &quot;Reality&quot;◆</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a meticulously crafted miniature-style 3D world—both whimsical and lifelike. With stunning visuals that feel like a living animated film, every step brings the world vividly to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879660/extras/bc7c47cbaaa4a3e63100a6fc4e5cb51d.avif?t=1787882916\" width=650 height=290 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >◆Exploration Filled With Fun and Danger◆</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy adventure-filled box garden exploration with surprises at every turn. Experience lighthearted and charming combat while leading your team through thick and thin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879660/extras/6f2d17847aaa6c1ff05bd2247a0e858a.avif?t=1787882916\" width=650 height=290 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >◆Meet Charismatic Exploration Members◆</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Form your own exploration squad, travel between &quot;Reality&quot; and &quot;Field&quot;, and build trust with your teammates through adventures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >◆Create Dream Homes and Customize Styles◆</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Personalize explorers' outfits with multi-part dyeing and fashion combinations. Build your plaza home with creative ideas using multiple furniture themes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879660/extras/76c8f773c9bdf44dfe5adeff292d3467.avif?t=1787882916\" width=650 height=290 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >◆Enjoy Daily Life Beyond Adventures◆</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seaside tranquility, forest swings... Perfect spots for solitude to heal life's fatigue. For socializing, join barbecue parties, dynamic soccer games, and COSPLAY contests! Meet the life and friends you've been longing for at Rota Plaza - always a place to enjoy the world's beauty!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879660/extras/2e42fd4c407f22609e0ccbcfccba3659.avif?t=1787882916\" width=648 height=292 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879660/extras/8815e45974565a718304f2e9fa1ad396.avif?t=1787882916\" width=1560 height=406 /></span>Worldview</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rota Tech is recruiting new members! You'll become the new Leader of the exploration team through tests!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this world lies a hidden realm known as the “OverField”—a mysterious frontier at the very heart of Rota’s research. You'll encounter various events with explorers, face challenges from mysterious forces, and uncover the truth behind the “OverField”.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >▼Game Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >◆Fantastical &quot;Field&quot; Within &quot;Reality&quot;◆</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a meticulously crafted miniature-style 3D world—both whimsical and lifelike. With stunning visuals that feel like a living animated film, every step brings the world vividly to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879660/extras/bc7c47cbaaa4a3e63100a6fc4e5cb51d.avif?t=1787882916\" width=650 height=290 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >◆Exploration Filled With Fun and Danger◆</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy adventure-filled box garden exploration with surprises at every turn. Experience lighthearted and charming combat while leading your team through thick and thin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879660/extras/6f2d17847aaa6c1ff05bd2247a0e858a.avif?t=1787882916\" width=650 height=290 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >◆Meet Charismatic Exploration Members◆</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Form your own exploration squad, travel between &quot;Reality&quot; and &quot;Field&quot;, and build trust with your teammates through adventures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >◆Create Dream Homes and Customize Styles◆</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Personalize explorers' outfits with multi-part dyeing and fashion combinations. Build your plaza home with creative ideas using multiple furniture themes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879660/extras/76c8f773c9bdf44dfe5adeff292d3467.avif?t=1787882916\" width=650 height=290 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >◆Enjoy Daily Life Beyond Adventures◆</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seaside tranquility, forest swings... Perfect spots for solitude to heal life's fatigue. For socializing, join barbecue parties, dynamic soccer games, and COSPLAY contests! Meet the life and friends you've been longing for at Rota Plaza - always a place to enjoy the world's beauty!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879660/extras/2e42fd4c407f22609e0ccbcfccba3659.avif?t=1787882916\" width=648 height=292 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Tiny Miniature World Cozy Light Social Grand Open Adventure Hello! Let's explore the OverField together!", "supported_languages": "English, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Korean<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879660/f3ec8e517810f5432069e0ff0752d7360736e6df/header.jpg?t=1787882916", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879660/3df9c2c8102c7d2cc788c7b3b48984e25b4fa1f2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787882916", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879660/3df9c2c8102c7d2cc788c7b3b48984e25b4fa1f2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787882916", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> win7/10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 6 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 1060<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 25 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</s